# Sticky tabs: a tab remembers a home URL and a custom title.
# Pinned tabs are always sticky; any other tab can be made sticky from the tab
# context menu. Tabs in a group stay in the group; the whole group moves to
# the sticky area. Favicon dot shows state (green at home, yellow after
# leaving). Home command / Cmd+Shift+H and "Back to sticky URL" return to
# the home URL. State persists in the session and, for pinned tabs, in the
# pinned_tabs pref (also used as fallback when session restore fails).
# See docs/sticky-tabs.md.

